## Installation

<InstallCommand shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/input.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Input } from "$lib/components/ui/input/index.js";
</script>

<Input />
```

## API Reference

### Input

Styled wrapper for the Shards UI Input with custom size options.

| Prop       | Type                                  | Default     | Description                                                                  |
| ---------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `size`     | `"sm" \| "default" \| "lg" \| number` | `"default"` | Controls the input height. Number values pass to the native `size` attribute |
| `unstyled` | `boolean`                             | `false`     | Removes the wrapper styling, including the border and shadow                 |

## Examples

For accessible labelling and validation, prefer using the `Field` component to wrap inputs, or the `Field.Control` component. See some [related examples](/docs/components/field).

